0.1230.12to the working electrode of the analyte sensor. The method includes, in 808, selectively applying one of a first counter electrode voltage (e.g., first CE voltage VCE1) and a second counter electrode voltage (e.g., second CE voltage VCE2) to the counter electrode of the analyte sensor. The method includes, at 810, applying at least a first guard ring voltage (e.g., first guard ring voltage VGl) to the guard ring of the analyte sensor. The method includes, at 812, measuring current flow to the working electrode.
